    {
      "id": "cloudflare-email-sending-on-workers-free",
      "tech": "Cloudflare Email Sending on Workers Free",
      "href": "https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-24-email-sending-workers-free/",
      "cat": "Infra & platforms",
      "cat_id": "infra-platforms",
      "times": 1,
      "why": "Free outbound email to verified destination addresses only, which suits self-alerts and cron reports from Axum/Fly services over the REST API or SMTP (no Worker required). Sending to arbitrary recipients needs Workers Paid ($5/mo, 3,000 included, then $0.35 per 1,000). It's beta, and new accounts start with a low daily limit. Use it for self-notifications, otherwise park.",
